Here is a complete HTML file that recreates a pixel-perfect Space Invaders game, inspired by the original 1978 Taito arcade.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Space Invaders · 1978 Taito Arcade</title>
    <style>
        /* === RESET & BASE === */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            background: #000;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            image-rendering: pixelated;
        }
        /* === CANVAS WRAPPER === */
        .game-wrapper {
            background: #111;
            border: 6px solid #333;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 255, 0, 0.15), inset 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
            padding: 10px;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        #gameCanvas {
            display: block;
            width: 800px;
            height: 900px;
            background: #0a0a0a;
            image-rendering: pixelated;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px #000;
        }
        /* === SCREEN OVERLAY (CRT effect) === */
        .crt-overlay {
            position: relative;
            line-height: 0;
        }
        .crt-overlay::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0;
            width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: repeating-linear-gradient(
                0deg,
                rgba(0,0,0,0.08) 0px,
                rgba(0,0,0,0.08) 1px,
                transparent 1px,
                transparent 3px
            );
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        /* === UI === */
        .
